[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 4022.309, "timestamp": "01:07:02", "text": "我在那里待了一年。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4025.51, "timestamp": "01:07:05", "text": "是的。是的。嗯。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4029.19, "timestamp": "01:07:09", "text": "我知道。就像我们说的，我们……我们谈过了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4032.47, "timestamp": "01:07:12", "text": "和之前一样，也在私信里。对于那些"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4034.47, "timestamp": "01:07:14", "text": "不知道，我之前以为"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4036.95, "timestamp": "01:07:16", "text": "塞莱斯蒂亚当时不在印度"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4039.829, "timestamp": "01:07:19", "text": "一直如此。当我重新启动她时"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4043.589, "timestamp": "01:07:23", "text": "时间安排上，我当时就想，呃呃，我是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4048.19, "timestamp": "01:07:28", "text": "给她发送的是英国夏令时区信息，而不是英国夏令时区信息。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4052.789, "timestamp": "01:07:32", "text": "然后我就想，等等，什么？你什么时候……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4059.75, "timestamp": "01:07:39", "text": "我不需要你知道这件事，因为"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4062.71, "timestamp": "01:07:42", "text": "好像我把这件事看得太重了。"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 4064.268, "timestamp": "01:07:44", "author": "@Her_escapes", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/k5qSeiW9HuWS-yTlvFtkJFgjFQNzT4clVmOKs1PPP76ezfBidoUedboWgIi3wJy0ffSGpxX2Gy8=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "she's in Japan?"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4065.109, "timestamp": "01:07:45", "text": "搬回去也让人压力很大。我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4066.95, "timestamp": "01:07:46", "text": "不得不像包裹一样寄送很多东西，给予"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4068.63, "timestamp": "01:07:48", "text": "远离了很多东西。而我就是那种"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4070.789, "timestamp": "01:07:50", "text": "有时喜欢的人会变得依恋"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4072.75, "timestamp": "01:07:52", "text": "就像你说的，周围的物体。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4075.75, "timestamp": "01:07:55", "text": "我。所以我把很多东西都送人了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4077.91, "timestamp": "01:07:57", "text": "很难，因为它也是一个"}]